date-released: "2026-10-27"
type: "software"
abstract: >-
  An open-source, synthesizable, fault-resilient System-on-Chip (SoC) combining a 32-bit
  RISC-V RV32I pipelined core with a specialized hardware Multiply-Accumulate (MAC)
  accelerator for edge neural inference. Incorporates arithmetic Modulo-3 Concurrent
  Error Detection (CED), a zero-DSP online adaptive EWMA anomaly tracker, autonomous
  single-cycle shadow accumulator rollback, and complete ARM AMBA AXI4-Lite memory-mapped
  interconnect compliance. Fully verified across 18 comprehensive test suites including
  RISC-V International Architectural Certification Tests (ACT), Embench-IoT, and MLCommons
  MLPerf Tiny.
